  <div class="finding">
    <div class="fid">F6</div>
    <div>
      <h3>#141 is the keystone, and it is ready <span class="verdict v-clear">merge candidate</span></h3>
      <p>#141 merges cleanly, sits 0 commits behind <code>master</code>, and has all seven CI checks green — including <code>Build &amp; Test</code>, <code>Dependency Security Audit</code> and <code>Layer Protection Validation</code>. It also carries real security work: verifier session isolation, deny-by-default CORS, ephemeral verifier keys, and removal of hard-coded wallet recovery entropy.</p>
      <p>Three documentation PRs (#144 → #145 → #146) are stacked on it in that order, and its own description schedules the disposition of #105, #129, #130, #138 and #140. Nothing else in the backlog can be resolved cleanly until it lands.</p>
